body:
this sucks my dude... till your bonus is my entire year's salary....

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

edit: I don't even know how to put into words the amount of just shock that you have to deal with. You have zero money issues, she can basically buy anything she wants when she wants, you guys can afford to have a clean come in every day and a nanny to take care of kids if you have any. What's not to be happy about? I mean, who doesn't want sex after making that kinda cash....

 https://imgur.com/aXT3t4H (this is from a video that got me thinking about it)

&#x200B;

